%% frame: UC4 B10: subscribers at commit (design)
sequenceDiagram
    participant Svc as :StripeCheckoutService
    participant Tx as :TransactionTemplate
    participant OLS as :OrderLifecycleSubscriber
    participant Orders as :OrderRepository
    participant Out as :IntegrationOutboxWriter
    participant Share as :ShareCreditSubscriber
    participant Credits as :ShareCreditRepository
    participant Cache as :OpenDealOfferCacheSubscriber

    Svc->>Tx: executeWithoutResult(settle)
    Note over Svc,Orders: settle ran B6 to B9; each publishEvent was held for its listener's phase
    rect
        Note over Tx,Cache: BEFORE_COMMIT: synchronous calls on the committing thread, inside the settlement transaction
        opt TeamSucceeded was published (B10: UC5 B3)
            Tx->>OLS: onTeamSucceeded(event), @Order(10)
            OLS->>Orders: confirmByDealId(dealId)
            Orders-->>OLS: int confirmed
            OLS-->>Tx: void
        end
        opt blocbuy.events.enabled (distributed topology)
            Tx->>Out: onPaymentSucceeded(event), lowest precedence
            Out-->>Tx: void
            Note over Out,Cache: and onTeamSucceeded(event) if published; the writer's rows: @fig-a-ntf-ds-produce
        end
    end
    Note over Svc,Cache: COMMIT. Relay of the outbox rows: @sec-a-notifications
    rect
        Note over Tx,Cache: AFTER_COMMIT: synchronous calls, outside the settlement transaction; a failure is logged and cannot undo the join
        Tx->>Share: onMemberJoined(event)
        opt event.attributed() (A1)
            critical share credit, REQUIRES_NEW, 10 s
                Share->>Credits: recordIfAbsent(credit)
                Credits-->>Share: boolean
            end
        end
        Tx->>Cache: onMemberJoined(event)
        opt TeamSucceeded was published
            Tx->>Cache: onTeamSucceeded(event)
        end
    end
    Tx-->>Svc: void
